# rclone Configuration Directory
#
# Place your rclone.conf file here after running rclone config.
# The config file contains OAuth tokens - NEVER commit it to git.
#
# Setup:
# 1. Run: rclone config
# 2. Create a remote named 'gdrive' for Google Drive
# 3. Copy the resulting rclone.conf to this directory
#
# See scripts/rclone/setup.sh for detailed instructions.
